{"timestamp": "2026-01-14 21:03:48", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-85f4bb48-a315-44cb-91fe-30c1ac231916', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "task": "Create word pool data structures with family-friendly adjectives, nouns, and descriptors for whimsical name generation",\n  "test_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/tests/field/ensemble_ui/whimsical-name-generator/test_wordPools.js",\n  "code_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/whimsical-name-generator/data/wordPools.js",\n  "requirements": "Create data structures containing arrays of family-friendly words: adjectives (Whimsy, Citrusy, Sparkly, Dreamy, etc.), nouns (Cloud, Edge, Storm, Meadow, etc.), and descriptors (Strider, Walker, Keeper, Singer, etc.). Each pool should have at least 50 words. All words must be appropriate for all ages. Export word pools as named exports.",\n  "test_requirements": "Test that word pools exist as exports, contain arrays with proper structure, have minimum word counts (50+ each), and verify content is family-friendly (no offensive words)."\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_012W3VnaLBSkQDwPQyJHNokK', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_note', 'category': 'general', 'note': 'Starting unit test creation for whimsical name generator word pools. Requirements: Test word pool exports, structure validation, minimum counts (50+ words each), and family-friendly content verification.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_012W3VnaLBSkQDwPQyJHNokK', 'c