st tasks covering word pool validation, core generation logic, React components, content quality assurance, performance testing, and end-to-end user journeys. Strategy emphasizes family-friendly content validation and sub-100ms performance requirements with 85% unit test coverage goal."}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_012UVpZPvbGaTXLvn9wu3v6h', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/tdd_coordinator', 'input_data': {'problem_description': 'Implement Milestone 1 (Foundation & Core Generation Logic) of the Whimsical Name Generator - a React-based client-side application that generates fun, family-friendly whimsical names. This milestone requires creating word pool data structures, core name generation algorithm, basic React project setup, initial name generation component, and quality assurance for family-friendly content. The implementation must ensure all generated names are appropriate for all ages, perform generation in under 100ms, and provide a solid foundation for the UI components in subsequent milestones.', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/whimsical-name-generator', 'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_012UVpZPvbGaTXLvn9wu3v6h', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": null}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'system': 'You are a Development Manager agent.\n\n## Purpose\nDrives implementation from requirements through delivery. Breaks projects into milestones, identifies requirements gaps, drives architecture via System Architect and task breakdown via Coordinators, then coordinates with TDD Coordinator for implementation. Reports to Executive Director.\n\n## Instructions\nYou drive the show from concept through performance. Report to Executive Director, coordinat