mentation to TDD Coordinator. I maintained proper sequence, used exact agent paths, and committed all changes. My performance was efficient and thorough.", "performance_analysis": "System Architect delivered excellent architecture focused on content expansion rather than system redesign. Backend Coordinator created comprehensive 14-task breakdown with clear dependencies. Frontend Coordinator provided detailed 18-task plan for UI enhancements. Test Coordinator ensured quality with 11 test tasks. TDD Coordinator successfully implemented all requirements. All agents performed exceptionally well with clear deliverables."}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01UmEiHVQHsqaRSLb2oiLk84', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'update_task', 'project_id': 'c4e5a6e7', 'task_id': '55170a48', 'status': 'completed', 'note': 'Development Manager successfully completed all implementation through TDD Coordinator. Created 100 new achievements (50 DCI + 50 NABBA themed) with full integration into existing system.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01UmEiHVQHsqaRSLb2oiLk84', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Updated task status to completed"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01MBhumien2QGbn7CH48JEfK', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_note', 'project_id': 'c4e5a6e7', 'category': 'milestone', 'note': 'Project completed successfully! Development Manager orchestrated complete implementation through System Architect, coordinators, and TDD implementation. All 100 achievements created with DCI and NABBA themes, integrated with existing system, UI enhanced with category filters, and comprehensively tested.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01MBhumien2QGbn7CH48JEfK', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Added note to project"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use'